{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o088a","title":"曹操征刘表未至刘表病死","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o088a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"曹操征刘表未至刘表病死","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o088a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"南征","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o088a-q"]},{"person":"liu-biao","role":"病卒","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o088a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":208,"label":"建安十三年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"dongyuan-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"dongyuan-q-o088","basis":"建安十三年"},"evidence":["dongyuan-e-o088a-q","dongyuan-q-o088","wuzhu-q-o012","xunyu-q-o064","zhouyu-q-o009","zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-o088a-q","source_order":[6,486,"O088a"],"related_events":[{"event":"wudi-e-o121b","type":"related","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o088a-q","wudi-e-o121b-q"]}],"order":1762},{"id":"wudi-e-o121b","title":"刘表卒，刘琮继领","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o121b-account","label":"正文","text":"刘表八月去世，其子刘琮继领荆州，屯襄阳；刘备驻樊。","evidence":["wudi-e-o121b-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o024a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"《先主传》记曹操南征时刘表死，刘琮继立。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o024a-q"]},{"id":"dongliu-a-0f0c1d487228ddb6d4d8","label":"正文","text":"刘表卒","evidence":["dongliu-q-d732bcc72d77759440e2"]},{"id":"lizang-a-d194676a22ff1491e9a4","label":"正文","text":"刘表死，其子刘琮立","evidence":["lizang-q-afa4cb9a5a3d91fe7e91"]},{"id":"wufan-a-3715888f535b6aeac8a5","label":"正文","text":"刘表竟死，荆州分割","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]},{"id":"wangwei-a-25426394dbc4f105f69b","label":"正文","text":"刘表卒","evidence":["wangwei-q-d39f14336bf242f7f0b5"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-biao","role":"去世","evidence":["wudi-e-o121b-q"]},{"person":"liu-cong","role":"继领","evidence":["wudi-e-o121b-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"驻军","evidence":["wudi-e-o121b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"襄阳、樊","evidence":["wudi-e-o121b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十三年八月","year":208,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o121b-q","wudi-q-o119","wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c"],"chronology":"wudi-y208","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o119","basis":"建安十三年八月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,664,"O121b"],"related_events":[{"event":"dongyuan-e-o088a","type":"related","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o088a-q","wudi-e-o121b-q"]}],"order":268}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-biao","name":"刘表","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o088a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-36c489d1f93241a324d4","layer":"original","quote":"建安十三年，太祖征表；未至，表病死。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":485,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o088","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-36c489d1f93241a324d4","layer":"original","quote":"建安十三年，太祖征表；未至，表病死。初，表及妻爱少子琮，欲以为后，而蔡瑁、张允为之支党〖1〗；乃出长子琦为江夏太守，众遂奉琮为嗣：琦与琮遂为仇隙。﹝二﹞越、嵩及东曹掾傅巽等说琮归太祖〖2〗。琮曰：“今与诸君据全楚之地〖3〗，守先君之业；以观天下，何为不可乎？”巽对曰：“逆顺有大体，强弱有定势。以人臣而拒人主，逆也；以新造之楚而御国家，其势弗当也；以刘备而敌曹公，又弗当也。三者皆短，欲以抗王兵之锋，必亡之道也！将军自料何与刘备〖4〗？”琮曰：“吾不若也。”巽曰：“诚以刘备不足御曹公乎〖5〗，则虽保楚之地，不足以自存也；诚以刘备足御曹公乎，则备不为将军下也〖6〗。愿将军勿疑！”","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":485,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":290,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o121b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-031a374e9090ba29242f","layer":"original","quote":"八月，表卒；其子琮代〖4〗，屯襄阳〖5〗。刘备屯樊〖6〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":663,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o012","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-3843def972d8a772cdb3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春〖1〗，权复征黄祖。祖先遣舟兵拒军，都尉吕蒙破其前锋；而凌统、董袭等尽锐攻之〖2〗，遂屠其城。祖挺身亡走〖3〗。骑士冯则追枭其首〖4〗，虏其男女数万口。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o064","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-38f29d879d5ca24386ff","layer":"original","quote":"建安十三年，太祖破荆州，欲顺江东下。诩谏曰：“明公昔破袁氏，今收汉南；威名远著，军势既大。若乘旧楚之饶，以飨吏士；抚安百姓，使安土乐业；则可不劳众而江东稽服矣〖4〗。”太祖不从，军遂无利。﹝一﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":314,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o009","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。曹公得其水军船，步兵数十万。将士闻之皆恐。（惧）〔权〕延见群下〖8〗，问以计策。议者咸曰：“曹公，豺虎也！然托名汉相，挟天子以征四方，动以朝廷为辞；今日拒之，事更不顺。且将军大势：可以拒操者，长江也。今操得荆州，奄有其地〖9〗；刘表治水军，蒙冲、斗舰〖10〗，乃以千数，操悉浮以沿江；兼有步兵，水陆俱下。此为长江之险，已与我共之矣。而势力众寡，又不可论。愚谓大计不如迎之。”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
